# Alex Marshall

> Alex Marshall is an executive coach and artist based in London, working with founders, executives, and product leaders.

Alex is a former Silicon Valley founder turned executive coach and artist. He previously co-founded Twingate and worked at Dropbox and Bloomberg, spending nearly 20 years building and designing software products. His own years in therapy reshaped how he lives and works, and his coaching draws on an unusual combination: the humanistic therapeutic lineage he inherits from his therapist and supervisor, coaching training from the Co-Active Training Institute (CTI), and more than 20 years of business and product design experience. He grew up across four countries (Mexico, the US, Spain, and England) and speaks multiple languages.

